{"id":"prepositions-0143","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 143","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Advertising has a huge influence ___ children.","hint":"influence ___ sb","explanation":"have an influence ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"at","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Everyone laughed ___ his impression of the headmaster.","hint":"laugh ___ sth","explanation":"laugh AT something/somebody."},{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I haven\u0027t heard ___ my cousin since Christmas.","hint":"hear ___ sb (news)","explanation":"hear FROM somebody = get a letter/message from them."},{"answer":"after","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Could you look ___ my plants while I\u0027m away?","hint":"look ___ = take care of","explanation":"look AFTER somebody/something = take care of them."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They accused him ___ lying to the committee.","hint":"accuse sb ___ sth","explanation":"accuse somebody OF something/doing something."},{"answer":"between","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"There\u0027s a direct connection ___ diet and mood.","hint":"connection ___ A and B","explanation":"a connection/link BETWEEN two things."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I strongly disapprove ___ smoking indoors.","hint":"disapprove ___ sth","explanation":"disapprove OF something (opposite: approve of)."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"You should concentrate ___ one task at a time.","hint":"concentrate ___ sth","explanation":"concentrate ON something."}]}